Aplha 0.7.0
- Added saving and loading
- Added and reworked commands: 
  `resetdata [delay?]` - Will reset your data and kick you. Can be delayed if needed.
  `give [item] [amount?]` - Now accepts string ids in the format `soaring_upgrader`.
  `box give [id] [amount?]` - Gives you a box (id is for example "basic").
  `box giveall [amount?]` - Gives you all boxes with a specific amount for each.
  `box clear` - Clears all your current boxes.
  - You can now access the command bar on mobile and console by typing ".cmd" in chat.
